;
; Tutorial 2 art: a floor tile, two HUD icons, the player and a gem (converted by tools/art.ts
; at build time). Pixel values pick colours 1-7 of a palette; '.' (0) is transparent.

@palette ROOM_COLOURS      ; BG palette 0: 1-2 floor, 3 empty slot, 4-6 collected gem icon
$665 $332 $888 $0A4 $2E6 $DFE

@palette PLAYER_COLOURS    ; sprite palette 0: 1 cloak, 2 face and hands, 3 eyes and boots
$46C $FC9 $223

@palette GEM_COLOURS       ; sprite palette 1: 1 edge, 2 body, 3 facet, 4 glint
$0A4 $2E6 $8FB $CFF

@tiles FLOOR
11111112
11111112
11111112
22222222
11121111
11121111
11121111
22222222

@tiles SLOT
...33...
..3..3..
.3....3.
3......3
.3....3.
..3..3..
...33...
........

@tiles ICON
...44...
..4664..
.456654.
45555554
.455554.
..4554..
...44...
........

